mber":62,"title":"1.5.0.CR1","description":"","creator":{"login":"emmanuelbernard","id":300760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDc2MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/300760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard","html_url":"https://github.com/emmanuelbernard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":397,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-04-07T13:38:08Z","updated_at":"2020-07-21T13:05:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-05-20T19:24:13Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2020-01-28T12:26:03Z","updated_at":"2020-05-18T14:19:12Z","closed_at":"2020-05-11T09:18:40Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\n\r\nWhen trying to configure the generation of Kubernetes deployment file with secrets as volume, it ignores the properties.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nFile should be generated correctly.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\n\r\nDefaults are used instead of the configured ones. \r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\n```\r\nkubernetes.env-vars[0].name=GITHUB_API_KEY_TOKEN\r\nkubernetes.env-vars[0].secret=greeting-security\r\nkubernetes.env-vars[0].value=github.api.key.token\r\n\r\nkubernetes.mounts[0].name=github-token\r\nkubernetes.mounts[0].path=/deployment/github\r\nkubernetes.mounts[0].read-only=true\r\n\r\nkubernetes.secret-volumes[0].volume-name=github-token\r\nkubernetes.secret-volumes[0].secret-name=greeting-security\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe generated YAML file is:\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\nspec:\r\n        containers:\r\n        - env:\r\n          - name: \"KUBERNETES_NAMESPACE\"\r\n            valueFrom:\r\n              fieldRef:\r\n                fieldPath: \"metadata.namespace\"\r\n          - name: \"GITHUB_API_KEY_TOKEN\"\r\n            valueFrom:\r\n              secretKeyRef:\r\n                key: \"github.api.key.token\"\r\n                name: \"greeting-security\"\r\n                optional: false\r\n          image: \"quarkus/greeting-started-kubernetes-secrets:1.0-SNAPSHOT\"\r\n          imagePullPolicy: \"IfNotPresent\"\r\n          name: \"greeting-app\"\r\n          ports:\r\n          - containerPort: 8080\r\n            name: \"http\"\r\n            protocol: \"TCP\"\r\n          volumeMounts:\r\n          - mountPath: \"/deployment/github\"\r\n            name: \"github-token\"\r\n            readOnly: false\r\n            subPath: \"\"\r\n        volumes:\r\n        - secret:\r\n            defaultMode: 384\r\n            optional: false\r\n```\r\n\r\nNotice that readOnly configuration is ignored as well as secret-volumes configuration which is empty with defaults.","closed_by":{"login":"iocanel","id":402008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjAwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/402008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel","html_url":"https://github.com/iocanel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iocanel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/6826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/6826/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}